<title>INDIA: Indian Shipping -- Cochin cargoes - March 26.</title>
<headline>Indian Shipping -- Cochin cargoes - March 26.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the berthing schedule of major vessels loading and unloading at India's</p>
<p>Cochin port on March 26:</p>
<p> Commodity	    Tons	    Ship		    Berthing</p>
<p>		     (LDD/ULD)</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Sulphur	    17,000 (ULD)     Lok Kranti	     22/03</p>
<p>Raw Cashew	  1,940 (ULD)     Ronavate		 19/03</p>
<p>Muriate of</p>
<p> Potash	    11,400 (ULD)     Jaian Gehai	    17/03</p>
<p>Wheat		22,000 (ULD)     Lok Prem		 18/03</p>
<p>Raw Cashew	  4,100 (ULD)     Terekhovsk	     21/03</p>
<p>High</p>
<p> Speed Diesel    27,000 (ULD)     Kyriaokou		24/03</p>
<p>Crude		37,000 (ULD)     C V Raman		25/03</p>
<p>Cement		4,100 (ULD)     Roshni		   26/03</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>		  Note:</p>
<p>	    LDD - Loading</p>
<p>	    ULD - Unloading</p>
<p>(Source: J.M.Baxi &amp; Co, Cochin)</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
